decision_conditions:
Condition : 4 - The materials used in the construction of the external surfaces of the outbuilding hereby permitted shall be as follows, unless otherwise agreed with the Local Planning Authority: 
-	the front wall shall be red brick; 
-	the paint on the existing front boundary wall shall be removed and made good; 
-	the side and rear walls of the outbuilding shall be London stock brick; 
-	the roof shall be slate tiles.
